{"id":"4fd5a10d8f8ecab5","group":"58","path":"58/batch06/58-thm-levy-collapses.md","title":"Levy Collapse Properties","display":"thm-levy-collapses — Levy Collapse Properties","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-thm-levy-collapses","aliases":["58-thm-levy-collapses"],"display":"thm-levy-collapses — Levy Collapse Properties","depends_on":["[[../batch15/58-df-levy.md]]","[[../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md]]","[[../batch09/58-df-inaccessible.md]]","[[../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-thm-levy-collapses"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-thm-levy-collapses</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-levy-collapses — Levy Collapse Properties"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a400266e1814b901\" href=\"?note=a400266e1814b901\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-levy.md\">../batch15/58-df-levy.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"0fbfc19800246e77\" href=\"?note=0fbfc19800246e77\" title=\"../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md\">../batch13/58-df-regular-cardinal.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"06ee5d7ff126e916\" href=\"?note=06ee5d7ff126e916\" title=\"../batch09/58-df-inaccessible.md\">../batch09/58-df-inaccessible.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"5fb1c2241d1943d1\" href=\"?note=5fb1c2241d1943d1\" title=\"../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md\">../batch11/58-df-cardinal.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa&lt;\\lambda\">\\(\\kappa&lt;\\lambda\\)</span>（候选基数）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S\\)</span>（正则基数谓词）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{StronglyInaccessible}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{StronglyInaccessible}_S\\)</span>（强不可达谓词）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\">\\(\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S\\)</span>（基数谓词）</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Coll}(\\kappa,&lt;\\lambda)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Levy}_S(\\kappa,\\lambda)\">\\(\\operatorname{Coll}(\\kappa,&lt;\\lambda)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Levy}_S(\\kappa,\\lambda)\\)</span>（Levy collapse，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"a400266e1814b901\" href=\"?note=a400266e1814b901\" title=\"../batch15/58-df-levy.md\">../batch15/58-df-levy.md</a>）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}coll\\text{-}levy\\text{-}alias}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Coll}(\\kappa,&lt;\\lambda)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Levy}_S(\\kappa,\\lambda)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}coll\\text{-}levy\\text{-}alias}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Coll}(\\kappa,&lt;\\lambda)\\coloneqq\\mathrm{Levy}_S(\\kappa,\\lambda)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}levy\\text{-}collapses}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{StronglyInaccessible}_S(\\lambda)\n\\land\\kappa&lt;\\lambda\\to\n\\left[\n\\operatorname{Coll}(\\kappa,&lt;\\lambda)\\Vdash\n\\check\\lambda=(\\check\\kappa)^+\n\\ \\land\\\n\\forall\\mu\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\mu)\\land\\kappa\\le\\mu&lt;\\lambda\n\\to\\operatorname{Coll}(\\kappa,&lt;\\lambda)\\Vdash|\\check\\mu|=\\check\\kappa\n\\bigr)\n\\right]\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}levy\\text{-}collapses}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{RegularCardinal}_S(\\kappa)\\land\\mathrm{StronglyInaccessible}_S(\\lambda)\n\\land\\kappa&lt;\\lambda\\to\n\\left[\n\\operatorname{Coll}(\\kappa,&lt;\\lambda)\\Vdash\n\\check\\lambda=(\\check\\kappa)^+\n\\ \\land\\\n\\forall\\mu\\in V\\;\\bigl(\n\\mathrm{Cardinal}_S(\\mu)\\land\\kappa\\le\\mu&lt;\\lambda\n\\to\\operatorname{Coll}(\\kappa,&lt;\\lambda)\\Vdash|\\check\\mu|=\\check\\kappa\n\\bigr)\n\\right]\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>按此处的约定，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Coll}(\\kappa,&lt;\\lambda)\">\\(\\operatorname{Coll}(\\kappa,&lt;\\lambda)\\)</span> 把区间 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[\\kappa,\\lambda)\">\\([\\kappa,\\lambda)\\)</span> 中的基数都压缩到大小 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa\">\\(\\kappa\\)</span>，并使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span> 成为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa^+\">\\(\\kappa^+\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> 的量化在地面宇宙进行；若把“<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mu\">\\(\\mu\\)</span> 是基数”放进迫使语言，塌缩后该前件会变假而使陈述空洞。</li>\n<li>该 forcing 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"&lt;\\kappa\">\\(&lt;\\kappa\\)</span>-闭且满足 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda\">\\(\\lambda\\)</span>-链条件；不能无条件断言任意参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa,\\lambda\">\\(\\kappa,\\lambda\\)</span> 分别变成 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1,\\omega_2\">\\(\\omega_1,\\omega_2\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>特别地，若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\kappa=\\omega_1\">\\(\\kappa=\\omega_1\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\omega_1\">\\(\\omega_1\\)</span> 被保留，则扩张中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda=\\omega_2\">\\(\\lambda=\\omega_2\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"targ